[FS Operations Efficiency (Buyers, Content Editors, Price Verification, Image Review, Operations)]

Project background and challenges: Focused on business roles such as buyers, content editors, operations, and price verification, identifying efficiency pain points in work workflows and building/improving online product capabilities to enhance business efficiency. Core challenges:
1) Long new product launch process, time-consuming: Under Full Service model, due to unique new product launch chain steps including product selection, content editing, image review, and quality inspection, when industry new product volumes aggressively increased, each role needed to invest significant effort in following up new products, and individual product launch time was lengthy;
2) Low operations efficiency: Existence of numerous offline operational actions, such as buyers 1v1 following up with sellers on activity price negotiations, offline group chats connecting with sellers, manual product data analysis, etc.

Target achievement and results: Q2 completed buyer efficiency saving of 1,379 person-days/month, content editor efficiency saving of 678 person-days/month, image review efficiency saving of 162 person-days/month, operations efficiency saving of 88 person-days/month, totaling efficiency saving of 2,307 person-days/month; price verification efficiency improvement brought SPU cost saving of 20 RMB per item, efficiency improvement of 60%.
1) New product launch automation: Algorithm product selection introduced in new product launch chain; product selection, image review, and content editing review stages have been automated. Non-JIT automated product launch time is 4.7 days (vs non-automated 8.6 days);
2) Product sales improvement: Comprehensively optimized product selection-recommendation-setup-investment chain. Through major promotion automatic agreement registration & activity consolidation, early bird embedded product recommendation, etc., reduced industry price negotiation time. SEO title and image batch import improved product information optimization efficiency. Among them, new product T+30 early bird price negotiation rate increased from 35% to 62%, recommended product price negotiation 7-day sell-through rate improved by 2.9pp;
3) Merchant management: Built Feishu robot automatic group creation capability, replacing manual offline group creation by recruitment/buyers. Introduced and optimized robot Q&A capability. Robot accuracy increased from 34% to 61%;
4) Price verification: Established price verification form database, enabling automated/intelligent positioning and acquisition of BOM for similar products, further improving price verification data accuracy, consistency, and objectivity.

